    main, corner, stroke, grad, ...) never collide with CreateXyraxHubWindow's
    own locals of the same names.  Nothing in this function's body is
    restyled - it is uix.lua unchanged, just relocated and closed over its
    own scope; only the call site inside CreateXyraxHubWindow (Xyrax.Set/
    .Show/.Hide) is new.
]]
